                "Skyla"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_187_0077",
            "en_US": "The High-Flying Girl"
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_187_0078",
            "en_US": [
                "You’ll see smiles all around you,\n",
                "with the brightest of skies above you."
